* **False**: does not bring the database online.

> * For SQL Server 2008 R2, this value is always True.
> * If **IsOnlineDB** is set to **True**, **BackupMode** must be set to **FULL**.
> * If **IsOnlineDB** is set to **False**, **BackupMode** must be set to **UPDF**.

This parameter is required.', example='True', position='Query'),
  keepCDC?: boolean(name='KeepCDC', description='Specifies whether to retain the database- and table-level Change Data Capture (CDC) switches and change table data. This parameter takes effect only when IsOnlineDB is set to True. Regardless of the value of this parameter, CDC jobs are not rebuilt.', example='true', position='Query'),
  migrateTaskId?: string(name='MigrateTaskId', description='The ID of the migration task. Valid values:

