- If **BackupMode** is set to **UPDF**, set this parameter to the ID of the corresponding FULL task. You can call the DescribeMigrateTasks operation to query the ID.', example='None', position='Query'),
  OSSUrls?: string(name='OSSUrls', description='The shared URL of the backup file in OSS. The URL must be encoded. If multiple URLs exist, separate them with vertical bars (|) and then encode the string before passing it as the parameter value.

> This parameter is required for SQL Server 2008 R2.', example='check_cdn_oss.sh www.******.mobi', position='Query'),
  ossObjectPositions?: string(name='OssObjectPositions', description='The components of the OSS file. The value consists of the following three parts separated by colons (:):
