* **false** (default): A normal request is sent, and the modification is executed after the check is passed.', example='false', position='Query'),
  performanceLevel?: string(name='PerformanceLevel', description='The new performance level (PL) of the ESSD cloud disk. Valid values:

- **PL1** (default): A single disk delivers up to 50,000 random read/write IOPS.

- **PL2**: A single disk delivers up to 100,000 random read/write IOPS.

- **PL3**: A single disk delivers up to 1,000,000 random read/write IOPS.', example='PL2', position='Query'),
  regionId?: string(name='RegionId', description='The region ID of the instance.', example='cn-hangzhou', position='Query'),
}

