* **false**: does not automatically use coupons.

> If you use a coupon and then downgrade the instance type, the amount deducted by the voucher is not refunded.', example='true', position='Query'),
  businessInfo?: string(name='BusinessInfo', position='Query'),
  direction?: string(name='Direction', description='The instance upgrade or downgrade type. Valid values:
> You do not need to specify this parameter. The system automatically determines whether to upgrade or downgrade the instance type. If you want to specify it, follow these rules:
- **Up** (default): upgrades the instance type. Make sure that your account balance is sufficient.
- **Down**: downgrades the instance type. When the instance type specified in InstanceType is lower than the current instance type, set Direction to Down.', example='Up', position='Query'),
  dryRun?: boolean(name='DryRun', description='Specifies whether to perform a precheck on the instance creation operation. Valid values:
* **true**: performs a precheck without creating an instance. Check items include request parameters, request format, service limits, and inventory.
* **false**: sends a normal request and directly creates the instance after the request passes the precheck. This is the default value.', example='true', position='Query'),
  instanceId?: string(name='InstanceId', description='The instance ID.', example='rm-uf62br2491p5l****', position='Query'),
  instanceType?: string(name='InstanceType', description='The destination instance type. For more information about the instance types supported by RDS Target instances, see [RDS Target instance types](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2844823.html).', example='mysql.i8.large.2cm', position='Query'),
  promotionCode?: string(name='PromotionCode', description='The coupon code.', example='72329885****', position='Query'),
  rebootTime?: string(name='RebootTime', description='The restart time of the instance.

- If **RebootWhenFinished** is set to **false** and the instance is in the **Running** state, you **must** specify a restart time within 48 hours.
- Specify the time in the ISO 8601 standard in the `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mmZ` format. The time must be in UTC.', example='2025-04-03T12:05Z', position='Query'),
  rebootWhenFinished?: boolean(name='RebootWhenFinished', description='Specifies whether to immediately restart the instance after the instance type change is complete. Valid values:

- **true**: restarts the instance immediately. This is the default value.
- **false**: does not restart the instance immediately.

> If the instance is in the **Stopped** state, it remains in the Stopped state and is not restarted even if you set RebootWhenFinished to true.', example='true', position='Query'),
